<p>sar peeto aaj moosiye jaafar huwa shaheed<br />
ibn-e ali-o ibn-e payambar huwa shaheed<br />
ghurbat me aah kaazim-e bepar huwa shaheed<br />
lo momino'n ka saathwaa'n rehbar huwa shaheed</p>

<p>pilwaaya zaher baade shah-e qaaso aam ko<br />
haaroon na rasheed ne maara imaam ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kis tarha se bayaa'n karu zulme ahle kee'n<br />
afsos pet bhar kabhi khaana mila nahi'n<br />
faaqe pe faaqe karta tha ahmed ka jaanashi'n<br />
zindaa'n me choudaa saal the mahboob-e shaah-e dee'n</p>

<p>taaqat na thi zaraa bhi qaood-o qiyaam ki<br />
haalat ye thi imaam alailhis salam ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>di ummat-e nabi ko na hazrat ne badd duaa<br />
har waqt sheh ke lab pe raha shukr-e kibriyaa<br />
sindi ke taaziyaanou'n ki har roz thi jafaa<br />
behta tha qoon jism se roohi lakal fidaa</p>

<p>eezaa-e qaid aisi kisi ne sahi nahi<br />
bedaad is tarha ki kisi par huwi nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>al qissa zaher aap ko angoor me diya<br />
jis se janaab-e moosa-e kaazim ne ki qazaa<br />
baazo'n ne likha hai ye shahadat ka maajra<br />
pighlaake sheesh aapko jabran pilaa diya</p>

<p>kaise kahu ke haal huwa kya imaam ka<br />
jalkar huwa kabaab kaleja imaam ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghul padh gaya ke moosiye kaazim ne ki qazaa<br />
laashe ko laake jasr pe aada ne rakh diya<br />
aur chehra-e imaam se kapda hataa diya<br />
do roz yu hi laash ka chehra khula raha</p>

<p>thi laash bekafan shah-e aali maqaam ki<br />
touqeer thi ye aal-e rasool-e anaam ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nazdeek bhai tha na pisar tha, na bhaanja<br />
tanhayi me ye zulm-o sitam waa musibataa<br />
do roz tak to jasr pe laasha pada raha<br />
mayyat pe rone waala bhi hai hai koi na thaa</p>

<p>sadme uthaake haye jahaa'n se guzar gaye<br />
ghurbat me aah kaazim-e zeeshaan margaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shia nisaar aap ki ghurbat ke yaa imaam<br />
ghurbat me tum shaheed huwe aye shah -e anaam<br />
be jurm maara aap ko ya shah-e qaas-o aam<br />
haaroon ne haif kardiya kaam aap ka tamaam</p>

<p>qouf-e quda na qouf-e rasool-e quda kiya<br />
shamme hayaat aapki zaalim bujhaa diya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>misl-e tamaashaa dekhthe hai saare mard-o zan<br />
hai zer-e aaftaab imaam-e huda ka tan<br />
haaroo'n ka bhaai laash pe aaya basad mehan<br />
hazrat ko apne ghar se diya qeemti kafan</p>

<p>kaazim ke paas bhejaa quda ne fidaayi ko<br />
lekin kafan mila na shahe karbalai ko<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>